IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgta-i-canc-s22-2011`

-- Tests of the Telecommunications (Cancellation) Notification 2011 (S 22/2011), deposited 2026-11-04.
-- Every expected value is read from TA1999-CANC-S22-2011.txt (the Notification's items (a) to (m) and its paragraph 1), not from the L4.
-- These are tests of meaning.  The notifications it cancels are not deposited and nothing is asserted about them beyond their being named.

§ `Paragraph 1: in operation 21st January 2011`
#ASSERT NOT (`S 22/2011 para 1: the Notification is in operation on the date (from 21 January 2011)` (Date 20 1 2011))
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 1: the Notification is in operation on the date (from 21 January 2011)` (Date 21 1 2011)
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 1: the Notification is in operation on the date (from 21 January 2011)` (Date 4 11 2026)
#ASSERT `S 22/2011: the day it was made` EQUALS Date 6 1 2011

§ `Paragraph 2: the thirteen notifications, items (a) to (m)`
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "a" EQUALS JUST "G.N. No. 407/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "b" EQUALS JUST "G.N. No. 409/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "c" EQUALS JUST "G.N. No. 410/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "d" EQUALS JUST "G.N. No. 411/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "e" EQUALS JUST "G.N. No. 412/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "f" EQUALS JUST "G.N. No. 413/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "g" EQUALS JUST "G.N. No. S 262/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "h" EQUALS JUST "G.N. No. S 524/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "i" EQUALS JUST "G.N. No. 293/2006"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "j" EQUALS JUST "G.N. No. 1001/2006"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "k" EQUALS JUST "G.N. No. 119/2007"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "l" EQUALS JUST "G.N. No. 178/2009"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "m" EQUALS JUST "G.N. No. 1757/2009"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "n" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "A" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification named at the item, by its G.N. number` "" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT count (`S 22/2011 para 2: the notifications it names, by G.N. number`) EQUALS 13
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. 407/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. 409/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. 410/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. 411/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. 412/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. 413/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. S 262/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. S 524/2005"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. 293/2006"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. 1001/2006"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. 119/2007"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. 178/2009"
#ASSERT `S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. 1757/2009"
#ASSERT NOT (`S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. 408/2005")
#ASSERT NOT (`S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. 406/2005")
#ASSERT NOT (`S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. S 549/1998")
#ASSERT NOT (`S 22/2011 para 2: the notification is named in the cancellation` "G.N. No. S 23/2011")

§ `The two days: published 17th January 2011, in operation 21st January 2011`
#ASSERT NOT (`S 22/2011: the cancellation is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day (first published 17 January 2011, in operation 21 January 2011)` (Date 20 1 2011) (Date 4 11 2026))
#ASSERT `S 22/2011: the cancellation is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day (first published 17 January 2011, in operation 21 January 2011)` (Date 21 1 2011) (Date 17 1 2011)
#ASSERT NOT (`S 22/2011: the cancellation is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day (first published 17 January 2011, in operation 21 January 2011)` (Date 21 1 2011) (Date 16 1 2011))
#ASSERT `S 22/2011: the cancellation is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day (first published 17 January 2011, in operation 21 January 2011)` (Date 22 1 2011) (Date 4 11 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`S 22/2011: the cancellation is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day (first published 17 January 2011, in operation 21 January 2011)` (Date 20 1 2011) (Date 17 1 2011))
#ASSERT `S 22/2011: the cancellation is in operation for the conduct day, as read on the reading day (first published 17 January 2011, in operation 21 January 2011)` (Date 4 11 2026) (Date 4 11 2026)
